WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
The big room: a long wooden table,
floor cushions and a round story rug.

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.800
A room for babies, with cots,
a baby gym and soft mats.

3
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:16.000
A cosy room with armchairs, books
and pictures on the wall.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.200
A calm room with a sofa,
a rug and low shelves of toys.

5
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.800
Block play: wooden blocks, tree slices,
two tyres and a plank.
